      "widgets_values": [
        "# Qwen-Image 2.1 text to image\n\n## Models (Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1)\n\n- diffusion_models: [qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors) (or qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot for lower VRAM)\n- text_encoders: [qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors) (or qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot)\n- vae: [qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors)\n\nNeeds ComfyUI with native Qwen-Image 2.1 support (0.37+).\ncfg 1 = official path (negative prompt unused). Official pipeline uses 40-50 euler steps; 25 is the Comfy template default.\n\nNative 2K: 2048x2048 works directly. Prefer multiples of 32.\n\nOutput is RGB: the VAE decodes RGBA, and its alpha is dropped because it is slightly noisy on normal images.\nFor transparent assets use text_to_img_qwen21_rgba.json.\n"
      ]
    }
